{"id":"29fbec40b82850a1","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kt-ce.md","title":"存在不可计算 c.e. K 平凡集","display":"thm-kt-ce — 存在不可计算 c.e. K 平凡集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kt-ce","aliases":["43-thm-kt-ce"],"display":"thm-kt-ce — 存在不可计算 c.e. K 平凡集","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-ktrivial]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.15.1.4, printed pp.407–408 / PDF pp.427–428","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kt-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kt-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kt-ce — 存在不可计算 c.e. K 平凡集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.15.1.4, printed pp.407–408 / PDF pp.427–428"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是其特征函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivial}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Computable}(\\chi_A)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Computable}(\\chi_A)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>核对书中尾和构造：每个非计算要求最多消费 2^{-(e+2)}，总 Kraft 请求量不超过一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-